&_nc_oc=Adqr8zgceAK5OH0w7x-xyJhxj3H5ZPFTUrNxd8z-hGUrMDLQsj8NMJV9gtwuWVttvTk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNajh7tkhzt8NE7e0nA4oGw7o3VVmX7VfJnutP62wmT5Q&oe=6AC11C3E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eyehS-qwdMQQ7kNvwEMF2-8&_nc_oc=Adozf4guhdGyv6GTRrRimhdBMNj6ydvvuuo_wkSg8EnT3hd_zaP4dbGDu1IK0TiMdAE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNOiYc33T-VfY6vx4RlTl6NbXXTWhRNJw0mPqb6I-3-Ag&oe=6AC12D3C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IW6U-secnCoQ7kNvwEMZOFl&_nc_oc=AdrkU5U1g9NJu1vPzRcIloo6IF5zvsFwJY5mmyybI7xFAkO7Rgo5sAZqwMMrrsVph3s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOXRABdRfDxsKPAN7yPpO3-XmEHq3NBp7HyLeceY1PBPA&oe=6AC11387"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h3Om2Re66fEQ7kNvwFrrL1K&_nc_oc=AdrFQOaqRw_Fp7vCuxYtUO2b9IQw1mDMlziNEuvzGOwAOzQenRHYJ2ZxSqr6I-Y0xac&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMFRWCUfkGNIrEmFZvIwXOFqCtRt8u80H_ctQCrhQoFTg&oe=6AC0FF55"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v191G7o1Y6oQ7kNvwGrah1i&_nc_oc=AdpSOEg2rGlvHeprxoG3aYCPVmx4D6PFWCFVjSbwSDbGkAz6PsKcoGZZ4RS0sXjo--4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP8JRcImErPQxbJdOrbETCsQeiwCS5NiP50DtcohjeKww&oe=6AC10BE4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.